teractive charts.\nPortfolio Tracking: Monitor investments, portfolio performance, risk exposure, and potential opportunities.\nAI Market Sentiment Analysis: Analyze financial news, announcements, and market sentiment to identify factors influencing stock movements.\nPersonalized Alerts: Notifications for price movements, predicted trends, significant market changes, and trading opportunities.\nTechnical Expectations:\nNative or cross-platform mobile development (Flutter / React Native).\nIntegration with reliable real-time stock market data APIs.\nPython-based AI/ML models for forecasting and predictive analytics.\nBackend infrastructure for data processing, model execution, and user management.\nSecure authentication and scalable architecture.\nExpected Outcome:\nA fully functional, scalable AI-powered stock market intelligence application with an intuitive interface, reliable analytics, and explainable predictions.\nWe are open to discussing the appropriate AI/ML approach, data providers, technology stack, and development phases with experienced developers.","jobs":[{"id":3,"name":"PHP","category":{"id":1,"name":"Websites, IT & Software"},"active_project_count":null,"seo_url":"php","seo_info":null,"local":false,"questions":null},{"id":13,"name":"Python","category":{"id":1,"name":"Websites, IT & Software"},"active_project_count":null,"seo_url":"python","seo_info":null,"local":false,"questions":null},{"id":44,"name":"Mobile App Development","category":{"id":9,"name":"Mobile Phones & Computing"},"active_project_count":null,"seo_url":"mobile_app_development","seo_info":null,"local":false,"questions":null},{"id":759,"name":"React.js","category":{"id":1,"name":"Websites, IT & Software"},"active_project_count":null,"seo_url":"react_js","seo_info":null,"local":false,"questions":null},{"id":913,"name":"Artificial Intelligence","category":{"id":1,"name":"Websites, IT & Software"},"active_project_count":null,"seo_url":"artificial_intelligence","seo_info":null,"local":false,